                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bani Yehova ma fe mi dri egata onduaru e’yo vaza kililiruri be, eri ma azi mi Israeli ma e’yosi indi, ’dini mi ma mba azita Yehova Mungu minini ma ta beni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
